     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The place values are powers of 6 in base 6.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{421_6} = 4 \\times {6^2} + 2 \\times {6^1} + 1 \\times {6^0}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"4 \\times 36 + 2 \\times 6 + 1 \\times 1\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"144 + 12 + 1\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"157\"></span></p>"
    },
